<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on Roche.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on Roche.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc has issued 20 million American-style call warrants on Roche Holding AG, lead manager Bankers Trust AG said.</p>
<p>200 warrants control one shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    11,000.00 SFR	   ISSUE PRICE  4.75 SFR</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.JAN.97-15.MAY.98   PAYDATE	24.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 5000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
